          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "For each of the cases below, write the expression and identify its terms: If the teacher had called out ‘4’, Ruby would write If the teacher had called out ‘7’, Ruby would write Write expressions like the above for your class size."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.188,
            0.848,
            0.265
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? Example 9: Raghu bought 100 kg of rice from the wholesale market and packed them into 2 kg packets. He already had four 2 kg packets. Write an expression for the number of 2 kg packets of rice he has now and identify the terms."
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.269,
            0.845,
            0.32
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "He had 4 packets. The number of new 2 kg packets of rice is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 0 0 \\div 2 ,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " which we also write as "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 0 0 } { 2 }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.316,
            0.835,
            0.352
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The number of 2 kg packets he has now is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4 + { \\frac { 1 0 0 } { 2 } } ,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
